1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,246
Listen.

2
00:00:01,286 --> 00:00:04,110
That is real wind, recorded on Mars.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,488
One day, someone will walk there,

4
00:00:06,528 --> 00:00:08,460
eleven light-minutes from help.

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,510
Homeward is the map they can trust.

6
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,585
The whole planet, in true three D.

7
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:18,210
NASA's geology, heat and dust, layered.

8
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,960
The rovers' own photographs.

9
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,776
A route that keeps air,

10
00:00:22,816 --> 00:00:24,729
dose and daylight in budget,

11
00:00:24,769 --> 00:00:26,510
and always gets you home.

12
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:27,928
Every number real.

13
00:00:27,968 --> 00:00:29,510
Every source cited.

